## 🔐 SECURITY SUMMARY

### Current State (v5.0.0)
- ✅ Ed25519 signatures (RFC 8032 compliant)
- ✅ Byzantine consensus (2/3 quorum)
- ✅ Immutable audit trail (hash-chain)
- ✅ OWASP compliance 8/10
- ⚠️ Missing: TLS (TCP cleartext)
- ⚠️ Missing: Rate limiting
- ⚠️ Missing: Message encryption

### After v5.1
- ✅ TLS 1.3 mutual authentication (Layer 6)
- ✅ AES-256-GCM encryption (Layer 8)
- ✅ Rate limiting per IP/agent/purpose
- ✅ Proof-of-work on registration
- ✅ Encrypted key storage
- ✅ Database checkpointing
- ✅ OWASP compliance 10/10

