## 📈 PRODUCTION READINESS

### ✅ Recommended Deployment Scenarios
- Internal company intranet (firewall 127.0.0.1:5050)
- 3+ agent quorum (alice, bob, charlie minimum)
- Audit logging enabled (SQLite default)
- Centralized key management

### ❌ Not Recommended Without v5.1
- Public internet (needs TLS)
- Multi-organization federation (needs mutual auth)
- High-frequency messaging (needs rate limiting)
- Long-term data (needs checkpointing)

### ✅ Ready After v5.1
- Cloud deployment
- Enterprise federation
- Compliance-ready
- Public-facing services

